      "print": [
        {
          "title": "Holding data is a start. Making it work takes more.",
          "visible": true,
          "width": 390,
          "height": 907.078125
        },
        {
          "title": "Data that exists is not data that works.",
          "visible": true,
          "width": 390,
          "height": 907.078125
        },
        {
          "title": "A standing resource rather than a one-off study.",
          "visible": true,
          "width": 390,
          "height": 907.078125
        },
        {
          "title": "From records to a working map.",
          "visible": true,
          "width": 390,
          "height": 907.078125
        },
        {
          "title": "The same foundation could support more of your work.",
          "visible": true,
          "width": 390,
          "height": 907.078125
        },
        {
          "title": "Seeing a profile should not mean unrestricted access.",
          "visible": true,
          "width": 390,
          "height": 907.078125
        },
        {
          "title": "AI can assist the work. You decide where.",
          "visible": true,
          "width": 390,
          "height": 907.078125
        },
        {
          "title": "We would value your view",
          "visible": true,
          "width": 390,
